+// Src (AND(Src, rotl -2, X), OR(Src, shl 1, X), XOR(Src, shl 1, X)) into a
+// single flag-producing X86ISD::{BTR,BTS,BTC} node. Both BT and BTR/BTS/BTC
+// set CF from the pre-op bit value, so one instruction subsumes the other.
